    "description": "<p>Essence enhances the Solar's smell and taste. Gives two bonus successes on Awareness actions using smell or taste and allows perception normally too faint for human senses. The character can recognize others and hints of their recent activities by smell, track by scent (gaining one bonus success), identify spices and poisons by taste, and with a legendary success detect a few drops of tasteless poison in wine by noticing dilution.</p>",
